crumb"},{"@type":"Service","name":"Ice Dam & Snow Load Appraisal","serviceType":"Insurance appraisal","description":"Ice dam insurance claim in Maine paid short? Appraisal for hidden wall and ceiling damage, snow-load roof failures and winter repair pricing.","provider":{"@id":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"areaServed":{"@type":"State","name":"Maine"},"url":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-work/ice-dam-snow-load-appraisal/","image":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/assets/img/photos/icicles.webp","@id":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-work/ice-dam-snow-load-appraisal/#service"},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is an ice dam insurance claim in Maine usually covered?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most homeowners policies cover sudden water damage from ice dams. Some exclude the cost of removing the ice itself or long-term seepage, so read your policy."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I wait until spring to file?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Report water damage promptly, then supplement the claim when more damage is found after the thaw. Many policies require prompt notice."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does snow load collapse count as covered damage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Many policies cover damage from the weight of ice and snow, including partial collapse. Coverage for outbuildings and porches may vary, so check your policy."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can appraisal include damage found after the first payment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Often yes. If the carrier has accepted the ice dam loss, later-found damage can be included in the amount of loss set by appraisal."}}],"@id":"https://maineinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-work/ice-dam-snow-load-appraisal/#faq"}]}</script>
